+ \widehat h(g)&=\lambda q(g)h(g),\label{eq:tangfour}\\
  \chi(x,y)\bigl(h(x)E(y)+E(x)h(y)\bigr)
- =\frac1s\sum_tq(t)\bigl(&h(x-t)E(t)E(y-t)\notag\\
- &+E(x-t)h(t)E(y-t)\notag\\
- &+E(x-t)E(t)h(y-t)\bigr).
+ &=\frac1s\sum_tq(t)\bigl(h(x-t)E(t)E(y-t)\notag\\
